    "pr_body": "Executing a search query with highlighting and specifying `encoder` or `tags_schema` settings at the field level was resulting in an x_content_parse_exception.\r\n\r\nThis PR moves `encoder` and `tags_schema` highlighting setting on `AbstractHighlighterBuilder`, allowing them to be set global and at field level. \r\n\r\nCloses #94028\r\n",
